 click <a href=\"https://sproutorganic.com.au/collections/accessories/products/nuk-first-choice-plus-baby-bottle-with-temperature-control\"><strong>here</strong></a> for more information.</p><p><strong>Optimal mixing </strong>The ideal water temperature for mixing is 50-70 degrees Celsius to help the formula completely dissolve. Shaking the bottle for a few extra seconds before serving to bub will also help to dissolve it more effectively. </p><p><strong>Please note:</strong> We do not recommend an immediate switch to Sprout Infant Formula from another formula or breastmilk. The transition needs to be a gradual one so that your bub can get used to the difference in taste and texture, and so that their tummies can adjust to the change as well! Please click <a href=\"https://sproutorganic.com.au/blogs/blog/how-to-transition-to-sprout-organic-formula\"><strong>here</strong></a><strong> </strong>to find out the best way to transition successfully.</p>","page":""}},"tab_LNqWCy":{"type":"tab","settings":{"title":"Ingredients & Nutritional Information","content":"","page":"ingredients-nutritional-information-infant"}},"tab_fMbPnC":{"type":"tab","settings":{"title":"Feeding Guide","content":"","page":"feeding-guide-infant"}},"tab_YPXrHM":{"type":"tab","settings":{"title":"Directions for Use","content":"","page":"directions-for-use-infant"}},"tab":{"type":"tab","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Shipping Information","content":"<p><a href=\"https://sproutorganic.com.au/policies/shipping-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://sproutorganic.com.au/policies/shipping-policy\">Click here</a> to view our shipping policy</p>","page":""}},"contact":{"type":"contact","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Ask a Question","phone":true}},"share":{"type":"share","settings":{}}},"block_order":["custom_BcgyGe","sales_point_nXpPPf","price","judge_me_reviews_preview_badge_qDL6mG","text_x3wyTc","description","custom_eEhF89","separator_Pd3Cim","custom_y3DV9N","variant_picker","quantity_se